# The audit hook appends to this on every agent write, so it is permanently dirty and blocks
# `git checkout` on every branch switch. Three separate sessions lost time to that. The log
# still exists locally and is still the live evidence of what the agent touched — it is just
# not tracked. Commit a snapshot deliberately with `git add -f` if one is ever wanted.
